reccmp master: Import variadic function signatures

CV PDB argument lists use a trailing T_NOTYPE entry to mark a variadic
function. The importer currently rejects the complete function when it sees
this marker. This prevents Ghidra from receiving the name, return type, fixed
parameters, and calling convention.

Keep the marker as signature metadata, remove it from the fixed parameter
list, and set Ghidra's variadic flag. Include the flag in the match check so a
later sync repairs an incomplete signature.

Generated against reccmp commit e043de8b.
Apply from the reccmp submodule root with `patch -p1`.

